# Build context = repository root: only the gateway image uses it
# (docker build -f deploy/nginx/Dockerfile .). BuildKit reads
# deploy/nginx/Dockerfile.dockerignore instead of this file; this copy of the
# same allow-list covers the legacy builder (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0).
# The agent and api images use their own contexts and .dockerignore files.
*
!web/
!deploy/nginx/

# Host-built artefacts (node_modules holds host-OS binaries) and local secrets.
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/coverage
web/*.tsbuildinfo
deploy/nginx/certs
deploy/nginx/acme
deploy/nginx/htpasswd*
**/.DS_Store
